# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_lan / interface internal1
#   zone FWS_lan / interface internal2
#   zone FWS_wan1: no interface is known
#   zone FWS_dmz: no interface is known
#   zone FWS_ot: no interface is known
# Written inactive:
#   Admins to DMZ: not converted: groups netadmins
#   Block geo: references 'geo-blocked': FortiOS address type 'geography'
#   DMZ out via pool: host name object updates.example.com: the form of an address object of a host name is not in the documentation FWShift could read
#   Partner tunnel: service syslog-from-high: source ports, an ICMP code, SCTP ports or protocol 0, which a service object cannot say
#   policy-12: schedule 'office-hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times
#   Not web: every service but some: a service object of ZLD lists what it matches
